---
// Operations that scale with window length T: a recurrent net takes T sequential steps,
// self-attention scores T x T pairs. Log-scaled bars; numbers computed in Python.
const rows = [
  { en: 'T = 100 (DeepLOB window)', vi: 'T = 100 (cửa sổ DeepLOB)', rnn: 100, att: 10000, r: '100', a: '10,000', av: '10.000' },
  { en: 'T = 1,000', vi: 'T = 1.000', rnn: 1000, att: 1000000, r: '1,000', a: '1,000,000', av: '1.000.000' },
  { en: 'T = 150,000 (one day of events, one stock)', vi: 'T = 150.000 (một ngày sự kiện, một mã)', rnn: 150000, att: 22500000000, r: '150,000', a: '22.5 billion', av: '22,5 tỷ' },
];
const X = 330;
const maxLog = Math.log10(2.5e10);
const bw = (v: number) => (Math.log10(v) / maxLog) * 420;
---
<figure class="p15c">
  <div class="scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 330" role="img" aria-label="Log-scaled bars comparing sequential steps of a recurrent net with attention pairs. For a window of 100 steps: 100 steps against 10,000 pairs. For 1,000: 1,000 against 1 million. For 150,000 events, one trading day of one stock: 150,000 steps against 22.5 billion pairs.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>What a longer window costs</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cửa sổ dài hơn tốn bao nhiêu</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="48" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>Bar length is on a log scale: each gridline is ten times the one before.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Độ dài thanh theo thang log: mỗi vạch lưới gấp mười vạch trước.</tspan></text>
    {[0, 2, 4, 6, 8, 10].map((e) => (
      <line x1={X + (e / 10.4) * 420} y1="64" x2={X + (e / 10.4) * 420} y2="290" class="grid" />
    ))}
    {rows.map((r, i) => (
      <g>
        <text x="20" y={96 + i * 76} class="row"><tspan data-lang-en>{r.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{r.vi}</tspan></text>
        <rect x={X} y={78 + i * 76} width={Math.max(bw(r.rnn), 4)} height="18" rx="2" class="b-rnn" />
        <text x={X + Math.max(bw(r.rnn), 4) + 8} y={92 + i * 76} class="v"><tspan data-lang-en>{r.r} steps in a row</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{r.r.replace(',', '.')} bước nối tiếp</tspan></text>
        <rect x={X} y={102 + i * 76} width={Math.max(bw(r.att), 4)} height="18" rx="2" class="b-att" />
        <text x={X + Math.max(bw(r.att), 4) + 8} y={116 + i * 76} class="v"><tspan data-lang-en>{r.a} pairs</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{r.av} cặp</tspan></text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <rect x="20" y="302" width="12" height="12" class="b-rnn" />
    <text x="38" y="313" class="lab"><tspan data-lang-en>recurrent net (LSTM): steps, one after another</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mạng hồi quy (LSTM): các bước nối tiếp</tspan></text>
    <rect x="400" y="302" width="12" height="12" class="b-att" />
    <text x="418" y="313" class="lab"><tspan data-lang-en>self-attention: T × T scores</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>self-attention: T × T điểm</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>150,000 is the average number of order book events per day per stock in DeepLOB's London data. 150,000 × 150,000 = 22.5 billion pairs, which is why attention models work on short windows or compressed inputs.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>150.000 là số sự kiện sổ lệnh trung bình mỗi ngày mỗi mã trong dữ liệu London của DeepLOB. 150.000 × 150.000 = 22,5 tỷ cặp, nên mô hình attention chạy trên cửa sổ ngắn hoặc dữ liệu đã nén.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .p15c { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .p15c .scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .p15c svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .p15c text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .p15c .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .p15c .sub, .p15c .lab { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .p15c .row { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }
  .p15c .v { fill: var(--text); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .p15c .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .p15c .b-rnn { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .p15c .b-att { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .p15c figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
